            <tr>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3">Correct Schedules</td>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3 text-[#f3a833]">✅ Daily Updates</td>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3">❌ Often Wrong</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3">Mobile Friendly</td>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3 text-[#f3a833]">✅ Works Great</td>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3">⚠️ Sometimes Good</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3">No Sign-up</td>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3 text-[#f3a833]">✅ No Account Needed</td>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3">❌ Often Required</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3">Ads</td>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3 text-[#f3a833]">✅ Fewer Ads</td>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3">❌ Many Pop-ups</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3">Many Sports</td>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3 text-[#f3a833]">✅ Covers All</td>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3">❌ Football Only</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3">Backup Links</td>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3 text-[#f3a833]">✅ Many Links</td>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3">⚠️ Few Links</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3">Cost</td>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3 text-[#f3a833]">✅ 100% Free</td>
              <td class="border border-white/10 p-3">✅ Free</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">Why Soccer100 is Better</h2>
      
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-8 mb-3">1. Daily Match Schedules</h3>
      <p class="mb-6">
