      <p class="mb-6">
        While other sites ask for an account, <strong>Soccer100</strong> is open for everyone. You can watch <strong>soccer streams</strong> instantly, which is better than what <strong>totalsportek</strong> used to offer.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-8 mb-3">3. Many Different Sports</h3>
      <p class="mb-4">We are great for <strong>soccer streaming</strong>, but we also cover other sports like:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-8">
        <li>MLB — American baseball coverage.</li>
