      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">How to Use Soccer100</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">It is very easy to watch your team on <strong>Soccer100</strong>:</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 mb-8">
